            "urpx:description": "Schedule EAPR Section III.2 at above 150 to 200 percent of the federal poverty level: a 100 percent reduction in electricity usage cost up to a maximum of $0 per month, so the lesser of the billing period's usage cost and 0. Not prorated (Section VIII).",
